<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">fieldsmith</ansi>

Field Smith is a warrior's skill. With a field smith at the whetstone,
each sharpened blade holds its edge for 5 more strikes per level: 20 +
5 x level, so 40 strikes at level 4. The whetstone's uses are spent the
same; the smith only makes each use last longer.

It works whenever your company sharpens, by <ansi fg="command">sharpen</ansi> or automatically
after a camp rest (<ansi fg="command">help sharpen</ansi>).

See also: <ansi fg="command">help sharpen</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help specialists</ansi>.
